reços mais desejados de Curitiba.\n\nUma oportunidade única de morar em um empreendimento novo, recém-entregue, pronto para você personalizar e viver o melhor do Ecoville.\n\nAgende sua visita e encante-se!","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9714cbb3-7f1d-4988-8fba-69c9990ec117.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5cdf9ff5-5e22-4083-af0b-03a72c9efc5d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/18a8a971-fee3-40bd-a169-4a99070f134c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/736d40c3-3e04-4888-a8a0-a263928e3e8a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/bed2e120-bf36-4dea-8217-ec33bfa86a5c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a816e0b6-8bb1-4577-a76d-895868bda2cb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d4eb4a04-6f07-447d-a071-2b2114538a40.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2b265529-55dd-433a-a943-975156f79275.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2dc733fd-4f76-4cfe-bf13-79eb39908445.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/279324b3-6a3d-4475-a25b-15e78f21646e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/60629812-f166-49e0-a807-232ec3bebf62.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/69e11b78918c28b484de7fe0/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d285404e-b3e0-4fb1-9d6f-b07488b7e8b1.j